<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1539122249"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:29.000"><div begin="0.500" end="10.881" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="0.500" end="5.336" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.500" end="0.724">若</span><span begin="0.724" end="1.070">爱</span><span begin="1.070" end="1.433">是</span><span begin="1.433" end="1.776">但</span><span begin="1.776" end="2.116">求</span><span begin="2.116" end="2.742">开</span><span begin="2.742" end="3.602">心</span> <span begin="3.962" end="4.356">我</span><span begin="4.356" end="5.336">问</span></p><p begin="5.641" end="10.881" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5.641" end="6.523">要不要</span><span begin="6.523" end="7.179">求其</span><span begin="7.179" end="9.318">伤</span><span begin="9.359" end="10.881">心</span></p></div><div begin="23.916" end="44.014" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="23.916" end="27.012" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.916" end="24.456">论尽</span><span begin="24.456" end="25.164">半生</span><span begin="25.164" end="25.884">不懂</span><span begin="25.884" end="27.012">爱</span></p><p begin="29.265" end="33.435" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.265" end="29.725">回头</span><span begin="29.725" end="30.296">没有</span><span begin="30.296" end="30.797">心</span><span begin="30.797" end="31.895">计划</span><span begin="31.895" end="32.901">未</span><span begin="32.901" end="33.435">来</span></p><p begin="34.200" end="41.060" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.200" end="34.945">才来</span><span begin="34.945" end="35.612">独处</span><span begin="35.612" end="36.531">好好</span><span begin="36.531" end="37.782">检讨</span><span begin="37.782" end="39.492">什么</span><span begin="39.492" end="39.935">叫</span><span begin="39.935" end="41.060">爱</span></p><p begin="41.857" end="44.014" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.857" end="42.436">你</span><span begin="42.436" end="43.164">便</span><span begin="43.164" end="44.014">来</span></p></div><div begin="44.810" end="1:11.440" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="44.810" end="47.940" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.810" end="45.453">混乱</span><span begin="45.453" end="45.820">里</span><span begin="45.820" end="46.366">结识</span><span begin="46.366" end="46.992">到</span><span begin="46.992" end="47.940">你</span></p><p begin="49.932" end="55.028" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.932" end="50.570">浪漫</span><span begin="50.570" end="50.837">叫</span><span begin="50.837" end="51.449">一切</span><span begin="51.449" end="52.844">粉饰</span> <span begin="53.216" end="53.572">同</span><span begin="53.572" end="53.892">盼</span><span begin="53.892" end="55.028">待</span></p><p begin="55.150" end="1:01.282" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.150" end="55.940">某一刹</span><span begin="55.940" end="56.736">骤觉</span> <span begin="56.736" end="57.839">感情</span><span begin="57.839" end="58.818">深</span><span begin="58.818" end="59.646">得</span><span begin="59.646" end="1:00.222">可</span><span begin="1:00.222" end="1:01.282">爱</span></p><p begin="1:01.718" end="1:06.303" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.718" end="1:02.019">在</span><span begin="1:02.019" end="1:03.137">倾吐</span><span begin="1:03.137" end="1:04.469">那刻</span> <span begin="1:04.586" end="1:05.297">回</span><span begin="1:05.297" end="1:06.303">响</span></p><p begin="1:06.988" end="1:11.440" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.988" end="1:07.320">感</span><span begin="1:07.320" end="1:07.832">情</span><span begin="1:07.832" end="1:09.140">从不</span><span begin="1:09.140" end="1:09.709">是</span><span begin="1:09.709" end="1:11.440">爱</span></p></div><div begin="1:13.494" end="1:32.581" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:13.494" end="1:18.564" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.494" end="1:14.170">若爱</span><span begin="1:14.170" end="1:14.534">是</span><span begin="1:14.534" end="1:15.075">但求</span><span begin="1:15.075" end="1:16.874">终身</span> <span begin="